There is a user community of significant size hanging on your next
point release.  Users of recent ThinkPads, especially X61 and T61s.
ALSA 1.0.14 doesn't cut it for the AD1984 Intel sound card on these 
machines; your head revision, however, does.

This is a nudge to your release manager.  Please ship a point release 
soon so .deb and RPM packages con become available quickly.  Owners of
many laptops, including my X61, will thank you.
